1
00:00:00,616 --> 00:00:04,456
(Bernadette:)It's been wonderful, Sheldon,
thanks for asking.

2
00:00:06,222 --> 00:00:09,022
(Bernadette:)Oh, please stop
crying, I'm begging you!

3
00:00:09,024 --> 00:00:10,924
I don't know what else to do!

4
00:00:10,926 --> 00:00:14,096
(Bernadette:)My boobs are empty.
Do you want lasagna?

5
00:00:17,700 --> 00:00:21,030
(Bernadette:)Shh, shh, shh,
it's okay, it's okay.

6
00:00:21,036 --> 00:00:22,766
(Bernadette:)Shh.

7
00:00:28,544 --> 00:00:30,744
(Bernadette:)What have we done?

8
00:00:31,947 --> 00:00:36,147
(Howard:)Hey, I found superhero
baby wipes,

9
00:00:36,151 --> 00:00:39,051
(Howard:)the perfect way
to clean up crime...

10
00:00:39,054 --> 00:00:40,484
(Howard:)and tushies.

11
00:00:41,924 --> 00:00:43,624
(Sheldon:)Ugh.

12
00:00:43,626 --> 00:00:45,726
(Bernadette:)It took me two hours
to get her down.

13
00:00:46,729 --> 00:00:50,469
Oh, you-you relax,
I'll take this shift.

14
00:00:50,466 --> 00:00:53,236
(Raj:)You know, in India when
my baby brother cried like that,

15
00:00:53,235 --> 00:00:55,005
(Raj:)the servants would
just take him far away

16
00:00:55,004 --> 00:00:57,404
(Raj:)so we couldn't hear it.

17
00:00:58,674 --> 00:01:05,024
(Raj:)Not always,
sometimes we'd leave.

